# Vouched (and denounced) GitHub users for this repository.
#
# Only vouched users can open pull requests or run GitHub Actions from
# untrusted events. Collaborators with write access and GitHub bots are
# allowed automatically. Members of @pluralsh/server and @pluralsh/frontend
# (and other CODEOWNERS) are synced into this file by the
# vouch-sync-codeowners workflow.
#
# Syntax:
# - One handle per line (without @). Sorted alphabetically.
# - Optionally specify platform: `platform:username` (e.g., `github:octocat`).
# - To denounce a user, prefix with minus: `-username` or `-platform:username`.
# - Optionally add details after a space following the handle.
#
# Collaborators with write access can manage this list by commenting on an
# issue or PR:
#   !vouch [@user] [reason]
#   !denounce [@user] [reason]
#   !unvouch [@user]
